==English==

===Etymology===
From {{term|literate|lang=en}} + {{term|-cy|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɪtəɹəsi/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-literacy.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|literacies}}

# the [[ability]] to [[read]]
# [[understanding]] of something (ex. [[computer]] literacy)

====Antonyms====
* [[illiteracy]]

